6401       * Compute P(Yj|Xi) values from conjectured betas;
6402       data Exemplary;
6403       _B0 = 0;
6404       _B1 = -1.5;
6405       _B2 = 0.5;
6406       _B3 = 2;
6407       do X1 = 0 to 1;
6408       do X2 = 0 to 1;
6409       _pi = logistic(_B0 + _B1*X1 + _B2*X2 + _B3*X1*X2);
6410       do Y = 0 to 1;
6411       PY = _pi**Y * (1-_pi)**(1-Y);
6412       output;
6413       end;
6414       end;
6415       end;
6416       keep X1 X2 Y PY;
6417       run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.EXEMPLARY has 8 observations and 4 variables.

6418       proc print data=Exemplary;
6419       run;

NOTE: There were 8 observations read from the data set WORK.EXEMPLARY.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE PRINT printed page 518.

6420       * Expand according to relative allocations of design profiles;
6421       data Exemplary;
6422       set Exemplary;
6423       if (X1 = 0 and X2 = 0) then _alloc=4;
6424       else if (X1 = 0 and X2 = 1) then _alloc=5;
6425       else if (X1 = 1 and X2 = 0) then _alloc=5;
6426       else _alloc=6;
6427       do _i = 1 to _alloc;
6428       output;
6429       end;
6430       keep X1 X2 Y PY;
6431       run;

NOTE: There were 8 observations read from the data set WORK.EXEMPLARY.
