6434       * Run full model;
6435       proc logistic data=Exemplary;
6436       ods output parameterestimates=fitFull fitstatistics=statsFull;
6437       weight PY;
6438       model Y(event='1') = X1 X2 X1*X2;
6439       run;

NOTE: PROC LOGISTIC is modeling the probability that Y=1.
